nonlinear edits (M15b)
V1 in 0 2
R1 in vx 1k
R2 vx 0 2k
Vs vx vs 0 ; sense
R3 vs 0 1k
.param k=2
E1 eo 0 vx 0 table=(0, 0, 2, 4)
R4 eo 0 1k
G1 0 gt vx 0 table=(0,0,2,4m)
R5 gt 0 1k
E2 ep 0 vx 0 Laplace=2/(1+s/1k) window=1m ; transfer
R6 ep 0 1k
G2 0 gl vx 0 Laplace={2m/(1+s/1k)} nfft=1024
R7 gl 0 1k
E3 et 0 POLY(1) (vx,0) 0 3 4
R8 et 0 1k
F1 0 fp POLY(2) Vs Vs 0 2 2
R9 fp 0 1k
H1 hp 0 POLY(1) Vs 0 3k
R10 hp 0 1k
B1 bo 0 V=V(vx) laplace=1/(1+s/1k) window=1m
R11 bo 0 1k
.op
.end
